I don't know what the FAQ and spoilers say about this, but the fact is that on
multi user systems only one person can use wizard mode, and that person is
compiled in.  Thus, unless you can a) recompile it yourself; or b) fake your
login (tell me how when you find out); or c) hack into the wizard's account
(have fun!) you are SOL.  However, if you are the admin, then you compiled it
in the first place, so it's easy - look in config.h and change the "wizard"
def.  An even better place to look than spoilers and FAQs is the source code
and the README's that come with it :)

